#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strdup>()  function returns a pointer to a new string which is a "
"duplicate of the string I<s>.  Memory for the new string is obtained with "
"B<malloc>(3), and can be freed with B<free>(3)."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strdup>() devuelve un puntero a una nueva cadena de caracteres "
"que es un duplicado de la cadena apuntada por I<s>.  La memoria para la "
"nueva cadena se obtiene automáticamente con B<malloc>(3), y puede (y debe) "
"liberarse con B<free>(3)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strndup()> function is similar, but only copies at most I<n> "
#| "characters. If I<s> is longer than I<n>, only I<n> characters are copied, "
#| "and a terminating NUL is added."
msgid ""
"The B<strndup>()  function is similar, but copies at most I<n> bytes.  If "
"I<s> is longer than I<n>, only I<n> bytes are copied, and a terminating null "
"byte (\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq]) is added."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strndup()> es similar, pero solamente copia como máximo I<n> "
"caracteres. Si I<s> es mayor que I<n>, sólo se copian I<n> caracteres, y se "
"añade un NUL al final."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<strdupa>()  and B<strndupa>()  are similar, but use B<alloca>(3)  to "
"allocate the buffer."
msgstr ""
"B<strdupa>() y B<strndupa>() son similares, pero usan B<alloca>(3) para "
"reservar el buffer."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DEVUELTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strdup()> function returns a pointer to the duplicated string, or "
#| "NULL if insufficient memory was available."
msgid ""
"On success, the B<strdup>()  function returns a pointer to the duplicated "
"string.  It returns NULL if insufficient memory was available, with I<errno> "
"set to indicate the error."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strdup()> devuelve un puntero a la cadena duplicada, o NULL si "
"no había bastante memoria."

